                <td class="p-4 text-muted">周末露营</td>
                <td class="p-4 font-mono text-primary">50Ah</td>
                <td class="p-4 font-mono text-primary">3–5 晚</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-muted">短途出行无需太阳能</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-4 text-muted">较长时间出行（1 周）</td>
                <td class="p-4 font-mono text-primary">100Ah</td>
                <td class="p-4 font-mono text-primary">5–8 晚</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-muted">加装 50–100W 太阳能即可长期使用</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-4 text-muted">厢式车旅居 / 越野旅居</td>
                <td class="p-4 font-mono text-primary">200Ah</td>
                <td class="p-4 font-mono text-primary">10–15 晚</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-muted">搭配 200W 以上太阳能供全职使用</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-4 text-muted">极寒（-15°C 及以下）</td>
                <td class="p-4 font-mono text-primary">200Ah+</td>
                <td class="p-4 font-mono text-primary">4–6 晚</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-muted">对 LFP 容量按 20–30% 做低温折减</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
